							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "I present you <WebJam>: Pug + Atomic CSS Tailwind Preset + Automatic icon font generation from Font Awesome 7 glyphs + Special Atomic CSS brackets extension for Pug + Multi-page Pug extension from a single file + Images processing. Runs entirely as a static app on the browser. Live preview using a Service Worker that works accross tabs. CodeMirror based editor. Works with your local filesystem."
