		},
		{
			"x": -1428.1493689551244,
			"y": -2145.0415684281515,
			"rotation": 0,
			"isLocked": false,
			"opacity": 1,
			"meta": {},
			"id": "shape:h9UqFGVBuTFSjYJ6aBTv0",
			"type": "geo",
			"props": {
				"w": 479,
				"h": 108.91904561423553,
				"geo": "rectangle",
				"dash": "draw",
				"growY": 43.08095438576447,
				"url": "",
				"scale": 1,
				"flipX": false,
				"flipY": false,
				"color": "black",
				"labelColor": "black",
				"fill": "solid",
				"size": "s",
				"font": "draw",
				"align": "start",
				"verticalAlign": "start",
				"richText": {
					"type": "doc",
					"attrs": {
						"dir": "auto"
					},
					"content": [
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "I present you <WebJam>: my take on a community commons infrastructure for building websites. Runs entirely as a static browser app and uses no servers. Publishing is left out as an adjacent problem space."
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			},
			"parentId": "page:page",
			"index": "b10CPz",
			"typeName": "shape"
		},
		{
			"name": "",
			"color": "#11B3A3",
			"imageUrl": "",
			"meta": {},
			"id": "user:d4WFWnrn4m5__GkqKwyyR",
			"typeName": "user"
		},
		{
			"x": -2096.937350947356,
			"y": -1979.8234906760422,
			"rotation": 0,
			"isLocked": false,
			"opacity": 1,
			"meta": {},
			"id": "shape:-isdzz7S3XMbyA-HHsxD-",
			"type": "geo",
			"props": {
				"w": 639,
				"h": 441.9346807174493,
				"geo": "rectangle",
				"dash": "draw",
				"growY": 670.0653192825507,
				"url": "",
				"scale": 1,
				"flipX": false,
				"flipY": false,
				"color": "black",
				"labelColor": "black",
				"fill": "solid",
				"size": "s",
				"font": "draw",
				"align": "start",
				"verticalAlign": "start",
				"richText": {
					"type": "doc",
					"attrs": {
						"dir": "auto"
					},
					"content": [
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"marks": [
										{
											"type": "bold"
										}
									],
									"text": "Ezequiel’s Team Report"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "Hello world!"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "Over the past month I’ve been creatively absorbing myself into an exciting flow of code and design. I decided I’m a Free Software developer ("
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"marks": [
										{
											"type": "link",
											"attrs": {
												"href": "https://www.gnu.org/philosophy/free-sw.en.html",
												"target": "_blank",
												"rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
												"class": null
											}
										}
									],
									"text": "free as in freedom"
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "), and so I’m at peace with building software for the earth commons."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "While I have not been paid directly as a result of this work, I’m receiving the health benefits of having a focused creative practice in my daily schedule; which includes the joy of being alive and jumping gleefully out of bed in the morning so I can continue working. AND I cannot confirm or deny that the money I’ve been receiving lately isn’t ECCO finding alternative pathways to pay me for my work."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "The project that has been receiving most of my creative juice lately is <WebJam>."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "bulletList",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "listItem",
									"attrs": {
										"dir": "auto"
									},
									"content": [
										{
											"type": "paragraph",
											"attrs": {
												"dir": "auto"
											},
											"content": [
												{
													"type": "text",
													"text": "It’s a tool to craft websites by typing structured text."
												}
											]
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "listItem",
									"attrs": {
										"dir": "auto"
									},
									"content": [
										{
											"type": "paragraph",
											"attrs": {
												"dir": "auto"
											},
											"content": [
												{
													"type": "text",
													"text": "It’s made as a free and open source web-based environment that needs no servers and no AI"
												}
											]
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "listItem",
									"attrs": {
										"dir": "auto"
									},
									"content": [
										{
											"type": "paragraph",
											"attrs": {
												"dir": "auto"
											},
											"content": [
												{
													"type": "text",
													"text": "Can run offline and with your own files once loaded. "
												}
											]
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "listItem",
									"attrs": {
										"dir": "auto"
									},
									"content": [
										{
											"type": "paragraph",
											"attrs": {
												"dir": "auto"
											},
											"content": [
												{
													"type": "text",
													"text": "It has a special easy to learn syntax and it’s evolving rapidly."
												}
											]
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"type": "listItem",
									"attrs": {
										"dir": "auto"
									},
									"content": [
										{
											"type": "paragraph",
											"attrs": {
												"dir": "auto"
											},
											"content": [
												{
													"type": "text",
													"text": "The system has no publishing included; there is no server-based platform."
												}
											]
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "You can open the latest version at "
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"marks": [
										{
											"type": "link",
											"attrs": {
												"href": "https://webjam.space",
												"target": "_blank",
												"rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
												"class": null
											}
										}
									],
									"text": "https://webjam.space"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "And there is a visual "
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"marks": [
										{
											"type": "link",
											"attrs": {
												"href": "https://webjam.space/roadmap",
												"target": "_blank",
												"rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
												"class": null
											}
										}
									],
									"text": "roadmap"
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": ", where I’ve been documenting what’s been done and what’s next."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "My hope is that I can sell the story of this as a powerful self-soverign community tool for crafting resilient and lightweight web-based infrastructure for earth centric cultures. And that as part of that story, I’m the current steward of this tool and then I get financial support from people and foundations. And so I can fearlessly pour myself into this project knowing I’m backed and my human needs are taken care of."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "It’s an ingenious plan that might just work; for me."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						}
					]
				}
			},
